  "details": "For now, all notifications are sent from one channel, they have the same icon. I recommend that each notification type should own a channel and icon.\n\nOnce each notification type owns a channel, we can choose which notifications pop up or not. Also, the icons help recognize notification types.\n\nThe types of notifications are as follows:\n\n- Invites (includes replies)\n\n- Invite Requests (includes replies)\n\n- Friend Requests\n\n- Groups (e.g. Join Request, an announcement from groups)\n\n- Other (e.g. promotion of trust ranks, Impostor generation)\n\nIn addition, the notifications and channels in the attached image were generated by the application I created. there is no exist in the original app.\n\nRead more about notification channels:\n\nhttps://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/notifications/channels",
